      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was able to recreate this issue on PCVR when in a very large mesh collider (~2000m diameter) that was 70k vertices, in the same way MMMaellon does. Their workaround of using a non-trigger collider also fixed the performance issue on my end.",
