      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just experienced this as well on PC. Large single object mesh collider and the pens set it off. Weirdly enough there's no performance loss when doing the same in ClientSim.\n\nIt brings me from FPS matching my framerate (90fps, 72 fps inside headset) to 16fps.\n\nThis also affects the VRC Personal Mirror.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
