  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-29T17:05:32.503Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "1. create an object with a VRCPickup script and a collider\n\n2. check the \"Is Trigger\" field on the collider\n\n3. build to Android\n\n4. pick the object up\n\nperf loss is experienced only when object is held. Tested on a Quest 1.\n\nThis effect was not measurable in an empty test scene. But in a world where resources are already low-ish, the effect is very substantial.",
